OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fstart to the evening with a little
OL,7,Fbrightness. Otherwise, staying cloudy
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of light rain or
OL,9,Fdrizzle. Light west or northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day but some
OL,12,Fbright intervals breaking through at
OL,13,Ftimes. There will also be the odd
OL,14,Fpassing light shower.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,17,Fperiod is expected with variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud but some sunny spells
OL,19,Fat times. Southeasterly winds
OL,20,Fstrengthening on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
